  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/06/IMG_4127.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(80 fotos) La Font de Dins de Onda ha acogido la tarde y la noche de este s&aacute;bado una actuaci&oacute;n con mucho Sent&iacute;o, en dos sesiones patrocinadas por los locales situados en la plaza de l&#39;Almud&iacute;,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/06/IMG_3935.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 720px;\" /></p>\n<p>entre ellos La Cazuelita, para dar la bienvenida al verano.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdedinsjuny16/img_3899.jpg\" alt=\"img_3899\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdedinsjuny16/img_3900.jpg\" alt=\"img_3900\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdedinsjuny16/img_3901.jpg\" alt=\"img_3901\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdedinsjuny16/img_3902.jpg\" alt=\"img_3902\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdedinsjuny16/img_3903.jpg\" alt=\"img_3903\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdedinsjuny16/img_3904.jpg\" alt=\"img_3904\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdedinsjuny16/img_3906.jpg\" alt=\"img_3906\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdedinsjuny16/img_3907.jpg\" alt=\"img_3907\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0